      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha kiro kya mbere ky'omwezi gwa mushanju habeho enteko, mufukame. Mutalikora mulimo gwa mpita. Kiro kyonene ekyo mutere amakondere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muratambaga ekitambo ky'okwokibwa eky'akataachu ak'okushemelera Omukama. Mugire enumi emoi y'ekigeto, empaya emoi y'entaama, n'obupaya mushanju bw'emyana y'entaama obw'omwaka gumoi, byona ebi bibe bitaina kamogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bigendweho ebihongo byabyo eby'ensano enungi etabiraine n'amajuta. Buli numi negendwaho ekilo ishatu z'ensano; empaya y'entaama negendwaho ekilo ibili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi obwana bw'entaama omushanju buli kamoi nikagendwaho ekilo emoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hataburwaho mpaya ya mbuzi ey'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'amafu aha rw'okwatilira amafu ganyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamoi n'ebyo ebindi niby'ebi: Ekihongo ky'okwokibwa orwo okwezi kwemire, hamoi n'ekihongo kyakyo ky'ensano ekikaigendaho; n'ekihongo kya buli kiro eky'okwokibwa n'ekihongo kyakyo ky'ensano okwo bikagenda hamoi, n'ebihongo byabyo eby'okunywa, nk'okwo omugenzo gulikubiragira. Ebihongo ebi byona by'okurugwamu akatachu ak'okushemelera Omukama.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha kiro kya ikumi ky'omwezi ogu gwa mushanju habeho enteko, mufukame, mara mweshase. Mutalikora mulimo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shana mutambire Omukama ebitambo, eby'akataachu ak'okumushemelera. Mutambe enumi emoi y'ekigeto, empaya y'entaama, n'obupaya mushanju bw'emyana y'entaama obw'omwaka gumoi. Ebihongo ebi byona bibe bitaina kamogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bigendweho ebihongo byabyo eby'ensano nungi etabiraine n'amajuta. Enumi negendwaho ekilo ishatu z'ensano; empaya y'entaama negendwaho ekilo ibili z'ensano; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi obupaya bw'entaama mushanju buli kamoi nikagendwaho ekilo emoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muteho n'empaya y'embuzi y'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'amafu aha rw'okwatilira amafu ganyu. Orwo ebitambo ebi bilikutambwa, ekitambo kya buli kiro eky'okwokibwa tikibulimu, hamoi n'ekihongo kyakyo ky'ensano, n'ebihongo byabyo eby'okunywa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha kiro kya ikumi na bitanu ky'omwezi gwa mushanju habeho enteko, mufukame. Mutalikora milimo ya mpita. Mukolere Omukama obugenyi bw'ebiro mushanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumutambire ebitambo by'okwokibwa eby'akataachu k'okumushemelera. Mugire enumi z'ebigeto 13; empaya z'entaama ibili; obupaya 14 bw'entaama obw'omwaka gumoi. Ebihongo ebi byona bibe bitaina kamogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebihongo by'ensano nungi etabiraine n'amajuta ebigenda ahali ebyo, bitaburaho. Enumi 13 buli emoi negendwaho ekilo ishatu z'ensano. Empaya z'entaama ibili buli emoi negendwaho ekilo ibili z'ensano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emyana y'entaama ikumi n'enai negendwaho ekilo emoi buli gumoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakwo n'empaya y'embuzi ey'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'amafu egyeho. Hamoi n'ebyo mwongereho ekitambo ekya buli kiro hamoi n'ekihongo kyakyo ky'ensano n'ekyokunywa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
