          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha kiro kya kashatu mutambe enumi 11, empaya z'entaama ibili, obupaya bw'emyana y'entaama 14 obw'omwaka gumoi, byona ebi bibe bitaina kamogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubiteho ebihongo byabyo eby'ensano n'eby'okunywa ebikagenda aha numi, aha mpaya z'entaama, n'aha myana y'entaama nk'okwo orubara rwabyo ruli nikwo emigenzo yabyo elikuragira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mwongereho empaya y'embuzi ey'ekitambo ky'enyatano y'amafu, mutabulizeho ekitambo ky'okwokibwa eky'obutosha n'ekihongo kyakyo ky'ensano n'eky'okunywa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
