          "text": "“Ebyo nibyo muliba nimuhongera Omukama aha biro bikuru byanyu ebiragiirwe: Ebitambo byanyu by'okwokibwa, ebihongo byanyu by'ensano n'eby'okunywa, kandi n'ebihongo byanyu eby'emilembe, mutabulizeho ebyo mushangwa muragaine n'ebyo mugira omu bweyendezi.”",
